{[%cal Ge4e5] Moves: One square forward (or two squares on its first move);
captures one square diagonally.  When it’s strong:   • In the opening, it
helps control the center and opens lines for your pieces.   • In the
middlegame, it can create strong structures or passed pawns.   • In the
endgame, it can promote to a queen or other piece if it reaches the last rank.
Value: 1 pawn, but a passed pawn can become very powerful.}  *

